/-!
# A124035

Tridiagonal matrices of central ones with lower negative one to give a triangular sequence: first element is negative one. m(n,m,d)=If[ n == m && n < d && m < d, 1, If[n == m - 1 || n == m + 1, -1, If[n == m == d, -1, 0]].

The 66 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A124035

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [-1, -1, -1, -2, 0, 1, -1, 3, 1, -1,
    1, 4, -3, -2, 1, 2, 0, -8, 2, 3,
    -1, 1, -6, -5, 12, 0, -4, 1, -1, -7,
